-    // VAE Acoustic Encode
+    // VAE Acoustic + Semantic Encode, run concurrently.
+    //
+    // These are two independent forward passes over the SAME audio (one
+    // encoder produces "what it sounds like" features, the other "what it
+    // means" features -- see vae_model's acoustic_encoder/semantic_encoder).
+    // Neither depends on the other's output, so there's no reason to pay
+    // for them one after another: on this dev box they were ~1.05s each
